# Exact bytes preserve existing Unity YAML/meta/source hashes across platforms.
# UTF-8 text remains diffable; new files should use LF. No LFS needed at migration.
* -text
*.cs diff=csharp
*.unity diff
*.prefab diff
*.asset diff
*.mat diff
*.meta diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.fbx binary
*.dll binary
